"  servidor en el archivo <code>.env</code>; aquí solo se ve si están o faltan,\n"
"  nunca su valor."
msgstr ""
"Everything the project needs to generate pieces, store them and pay for\n"
"  ads, in the order it's used. Each card says what it's for, how it's\n"
